@prefix eco:<https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#>. @prefix skos:<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>.
eco:ConstructDoSeparation a eco:GovernanceInvariant,skos:Concept;skos:prefLabel "CONSTRUCT does not imply DO";skos:definition "Construction may materialize an artifact without granting it execution authority.";eco:falsifier "A constructed artifact actuating solely by existence falsifies this invariant.".
